Autonomous Data Preprocessing - Responsibilities of Each Agent
--------------------------------------------------------------

| Agent                     | Responsibility                                             |
| ------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------- |
| Dataset Loader Agent      | Loads CSV, Excel, SQL, or API data                         |
| Data Profiling Agent      | Checks columns, data types, statistics, and missing values |
| Missing Value Agent       | Detects and fills or removes missing data                  |
| Duplicate Removal Agent   | Finds and removes duplicate rows                           |
| Outlier Detection Agent   | Identifies abnormal values using statistical methods       |
| Data Cleaning Agent       | Corrects formatting issues and invalid entries             |
| Feature Engineering Agent | Creates useful new features from existing data             |
| Encoding Agent            | Converts categorical data into numeric form                |
| Scaling Agent             | Normalizes or standardizes numerical features              |
| Validation Agent          | Ensures the processed data is consistent and ready for use |
| Human Approval Agent      | Allows manual review before finalizing the dataset         |


